  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 103.53 Perched beach",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 103.53 “Perched beach” means a man-made beach that is designed to prevent the beach material from reaching the water by means of a physical barrier.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19; ss by #13945, eff 4-27-24(see Revision Note #5 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 100)",
